    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772820/extras/42d70a69184c0c859867da41f09cb9cc.avif?t=1745706487\" width=614 height=346 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772820/extras/db28666e61c7fd6659989f1641c7ee27.avif?t=1745706487\" width=614 height=112 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story</h2><br><strong>Step in the shoes of the greatest Knight to ever grace your presence... The ButtKnight!</strong><br><br>The kingdom is on the brink of ruin ever since the denizens of the underworld attacked without warning, kidnapping the princesses and fair ladies far and wide. With the land now in shambles and nearly maidenless... Sir ButtKnight must emerge from his humble retirement to set things straight and bring back peace!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772820/extras/15e13bb9764b05e0719a218430c359db.poster.avif?t=1745706487\" width=614 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772820/extras/15e13bb9764b05e0719a218430c359db.webm?t=1745706487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772820/extras/15e13bb9764b05e0719a218430c359db.mp4?t=1745706487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><br>Use various weapons, items, and powerups to slay swarms of evil minions. Defeat bosses to free the kidnapped beauties from their greedy claws. Show those monsters what you're made of and return to the kingdom with maidens aplenty!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772820/extras/72b4ac2ba598f23e9d7570e9dbac77cc.avif?t=1745706487\" width=612 height=110 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772820/extras/cb1e6ad96159bdd9499779824aca7a4c.avif?t=1745706487\" width=614 height=302 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Score high to get laid\u2122</h2><br>The better you play, the lewder the maidens will become. Tantalizing adult scenes await those with well-honed skills. Don't settle for &quot;good&quot;\u2014be the best!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772820/extras/773fc6d29f1dc8390e2bdf2c9e6430a1.avif?t=1745706487\" width=614 height=130 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772820/extras/839026d13591d39e4523749acbcf697d.poster.avif?t=1745706487\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772820/extras/839026d13591d39e4523749acbcf697d.webm?t=1745706487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772820/extras/839026d13591d39e4523749acbcf697d.mp4?t=1745706487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772820/extras/b46b874a4e7089feeb317063ef3eb6f6.poster.avif?t=1745706487\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772820/extras/b46b874a4e7089feeb317063ef3eb6f6.webm?t=1745706487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772820/extras/b46b874a4e7089feeb317063ef3eb6f6.mp4?t=1745706487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></s